---
import Button from './gb/Button.astro';

const essay =
  'https://medium.com/@drensin/elephants-goldfish-and-the-new-golden-age-of-software-engineering-c33641a48874';
---

<section class="section section-tight essay" id="essay">
  <div class="wrap essay-inner">
    <div class="essay-text">
      <h2 class="headline">Why an elephant, and why a goldfish.</h2>
      <div class="essay-body">
        <p class="lead">
          The model comes from Dave Rensin&rsquo;s essay &ldquo;Elephants, Goldfish, and the New Golden
          Age of Software Engineering.&rdquo; It explains the reasoning behind the split: context is an
          asset when you design and a liability when you review.
        </p>
        <Button color="outlined" size="md" href={essay} target="_blank">
          Read the essay on Medium
          <svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="m216-160-56-56 464-464H360v-80h400v400h-80v-264L216-160Z"></path>
          </svg>
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="essay-artwork">
      <a href={essay} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="artwork-link">
        <img
          src="/images/drensin-elephant-goldfish.webp"
          alt="Editorial illustration by Dave Rensin showing the Elephant holding the Source of Truth scroll alongside a swarm of Goldfish reviewers auditing design and code"
          class="artwork-img"
          width="960"
          height="540"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </a>
      <figcaption class="artwork-caption muted">
        Original editorial artwork from Dave Rensin&rsquo;s foundational essay on spec-driven AI development.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .essay-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    column-gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .essay-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 24px);
  }

  .essay .headline {
    margin-block: 0;
  }

  .essay-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .essay-artwork {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .artwork-link {
    display: block;
    border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--md-sys-color-outline-variant);
    background: #fdfcf7;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .artwork-link:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--md-sys-color-outline);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .artwork-img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .artwork-caption {
    font: var(--md-sys-typescale-label-md);
    letter-spacing: var(--md-sys-typescale-label-md-tracking);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .essay-inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      row-gap: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
